  "bodyHash": "1QlGqh7sYUU=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">這個資源包改變了許多 Minecraft 原版生物的樣貌！目前，它改變了以下生物的外觀（未來還會加入更多材質）：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 殭屍</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 骷髏</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 苦力怕</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 蜘蛛</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 殭屍化豬布林</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 洞穴蜘蛛</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 屍殼</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 豬布獸</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 烈焰使者</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a>（也支援 OptiFine）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">材質與模型的設計者為 AviArt。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要一個伺服器來和朋友一起遊玩嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_promo2.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"251\"></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你正在尋找一個能和朋友一起玩任何模組或模組包的伺服器，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong></span> 就是你的解決方案！他們提供品質最佳的 Minecraft 伺服器，而且只要點擊<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">這個連結</a></strong></span>並使用優惠碼「Lupin」，就能享有 25% 折扣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_summary.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"149\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">這個資源包改變了一些社群最喜愛的原版生物的外觀，現在它們看起來更逼真、更有趣！別擔心，它們仍然保持著原版友善的風格，同時又與預設材質有些相似。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"148\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>這能在伺服器上使用嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然！它運作得很完美！請記住，用模組和朋友一起遊玩的最佳方式是透過 BisectHosting，而<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這個連結即可獲得 25% 折扣</a></strong>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>這個資源包可以用在模組包中嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！但前提是它僅在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上發布。上傳到任何其他平台都將侵犯我們的權利，完全不被允許。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，如果你考慮將其加入你的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 模組包中，我們非常感激。如有任何小修改需求或疑問，請與我們聯絡！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"149\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/606/realistic-mobs.png\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1020/636/realistic-mobs-55.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"913\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1071/435/realistic-mobs.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1071/437/realistic-mobs-3.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></span></a></span></p>",
